# 0. URL/spec verification BEFORE writing any code (never guess a URL):
#    fetched the actual HL7 SMART App Launch spec pages.
#    https://www.hl7.org/fhir/smart-app-launch/app-launch.html
#    https://www.hl7.org/fhir/smart-app-launch/conformance.html
#    Confirmed: discovery = GET {fhirBaseUrl}/.well-known/smart-configuration
#               authorize = GET {authorization_endpoint}?response_type=code&
#                 client_id=&redirect_uri=&scope=&state=&aud=&code_challenge=&
