# 2. Found and fixed a real latent bug while starting this VTID: the
#    Shopify callback still wrote `shop_domain` to a column the VTID-03603
#    follow-up migration renamed to `endpoint_domain` — would have failed
#    every real Shopify credential write with a column-not-found error.
